  "A2_results_paragraph": "Era stratification highlights a post-2017 rebalancing of the follicular-patterned spectrum and a concurrent secular de-escalation of surgical management. Tier A H3 strict reclassification of MI-FTC to FT-UMP was 0% in the pre-2017 era and emerged only in the 2023\u20132025 era (1.4\u20131.5%); definitive total thyroidectomy at index dropped from 33.1% pre-2017 to 0.0% post-2022. The MI-FTC \u2192 FT-UMP counterfactual \u0394 widened in the post-2017 eras, indicating that the management consequence of the 2022 WHO threshold change is concentrated in the contemporary diagnostic environment. Cochran-Armitage trend for oncocytic-family share across the three eras is not monotonic (Z = -0.69, p = 0.490), because the 2023\u20132025 surge in MI-FTC and FT-UMP cases is on the conventional follicular side.",
