  "A3_results_paragraph": "Within the malignant/borderline subset (n = 572; size complete-case n = 529), larger dominant tumor size was associated with higher odds of definitive total thyroidectomy at index in univariable logistic regression (OR per +1 cm = 1.17, 95% CI 1.07\u20131.28; p = <0.001). Capsular-equivocal flags and any-vascular-invasion documentation were both individually associated with higher definitive-total rates (Panel C). The size \u00d7 capsular-broad-equivocal interaction was not significant, indicating that within this subset size and equivocal-capsular features contribute independently to surgical extent.",
