  "A4_results_paragraph": "In the multivariable logistic regression for definitive total thyroidectomy at index (complete-case n = 649; 891 excluded for missing tumor size), the strongest independent predictor was era. Compared with 2015\u20132019, the 2020\u20132025 era had markedly lower odds of definitive total thyroidectomy (OR 0.12, 95% CI 0.07\u20130.20, p = <0.001). In the family-only sensitivity model, oncocytic family membership remained an independent predictor of definitive total after adjustment (OR 2.11, 95% CI 1.42\u20133.14, p = <0.001). Tumor size was a small but significant adjusted predictor (OR per +1 cm 1.09, 95% CI 0.99\u20131.20, p = 0.075). Age and sex did not survive adjustment. Model fit: AIC 713.4 (Model 1) vs 713.7 (Model 2); McFadden pseudo-R\u00b2 0.215 and 0.201, respectively."
}